{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-instanton-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-instanton-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of categorical instantons","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-instanton"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-instanton-exists"],"tags":["existence","instanton","self-duality"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalInstanton.exists","text":"categorical-instanton-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-instanton-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a quantum observable universe with <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-Hodge star <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\star_q</code>. There exists a categorical connection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code> whose curvature <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">F_\\nabla</code> is <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\star_q</code>-self-dual.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-instanton-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.17.2"}
